{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Bush Warfare in an Open World Historical setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Tears: Angola\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced and immersive stealth-action first person shooter. Take advantage of your tools and environment to surprise and survive against outnumbering odds. <br><br>Welcome to Angola in the late 1970s. As a  fighter surviving in a hostile open world, avoid dynamic patrols and attack outposts for intel, resources and combat experience to live to see another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/9bc68c4dec22c5262aaa9c448c7047ec.poster.avif?t=1771922771\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/9bc68c4dec22c5262aaa9c448c7047ec.webm?t=1771922771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/9bc68c4dec22c5262aaa9c448c7047ec.mp4?t=1771922771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach with each encounter - stealth or loud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal takedown animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Cold War era weapons &amp; gadgets, with jamming &amp; crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear Open World with chaotic AI Skirmishes &amp; Faction Conquest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassination Targets roaming the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outposts &amp; Dynamic Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intel Gathering System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Continuation Respawn Events</p></li><li